{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-vice-versa-boutique-leo-face-sticker-2601-0347","content_id":"92182dc7-ab77-4426-88f1-5460a777cc85","description":"Product Safety Report for Vice Versa Boutique Leo Face Sticker presenting a serious chemical risk. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"14e61f59-6fd7-4921-9a6a-f2bd61c77d96","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-06-17T13:29:46+01:00","id":"14e61f59-6fd7-4921-9a6a-f2bd61c77d96","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-06-17T13:29:46+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a32933a00ff27f06e3ef96e/2601-0347-product-safety-report-vice-versa-boutique-leo-face-sticker.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Vice Versa Boutique Leo Face Sticker</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious chemical risk as they have been found to contain excess concentrations of phthalates.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been withdrawn from the market by Vice Versa Boutique.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys – Fancy Dress Accessories (Non Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Vice Versa Boutique </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>Leo</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>India</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>A printed face sticker, supplied in a clear plastic packaging.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_14e61f59-6fd7-4921-9a6a-f2bd61c77d96\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a32933a00ff27f06e3ef96e/2601-0347-product-safety-report-vice-versa-boutique-leo-face-sticker.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious chemical risk as they have been found to contain excess concentrations of phthalates. Phthalates may harm the health of children, possibly causing damage to the reproductive system. Improvements are also required to the product markings and warning labelling.  </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been withdrawn from the market by Vice Versa Boutique. Consumers should stop using the product immediately and contact the distributor for redress.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2601-0347</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-06-17T12:30:16Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["withdrawal-of-product-from-market"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-06-17","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-06-17T13:30:16+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-vice-versa-boutique-leo-face-sticker-2601-0347","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-vice-versa-boutique-leo-face-sticker-2601